  "solution": {
    "text": "Given function is <math> <mrow>  <mi>f</mi><mfenced>   <mrow>    <mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow>  </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#x22C5;</mo><mfrac>   <mrow>    <mi>sin</mi><mfenced>     <mrow>      <mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow>    </mfenced></mrow>   <mi>n</mi>  </mfrac>  <mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></math><br />As <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br />If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , we have <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />",
